Bundle-Name: SensiNact Southbound Payload Sampling
Bundle-Description: Collects the payloads a runtime has no model for into per-channel \
 sample sets, so that model inference sees a set rather than a single payload: it binds \
 the ingress' UnknownModelHandler hook, buffers a bounded ring of distinctly shaped \
 payloads per channel, and hands the closed set to a PayloadSampleSetHandler once.

-workingset: SensiNact

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.southbound.common;version=snapshot,\
	tools.jackson.core.jackson-core;version=latest
